(6601681, 985077, 136704, '<td valign="top">It might be me, but it looks really soft to me. If it''s sharp SOOC you might have issues when downsizing... unsharp mask works wonders before AND after downsizing. Just a thought.<br/> <br/>Lovely photo. A bit too tight cropped for me, though.</td>', 'It might be me, but it looks really soft to me. If it''s sharp SOOC you might have issues when downsizing... unsharp mask works wonders before AND after downsizing. Just a thought. Lovely photo. A bit too tight cropped for me, though.', '2011-11-23 06:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601684, 985156, 136704, '<td valign="top">Too much smoothing of the skin, in my opinion. Great detail in the eyes.</td>', 'Too much smoothing of the skin, in my opinion. Great detail in the eyes.', '2011-11-23 06:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601685, 984987, 136704, '<td valign="top">A bit too saturated - the red sweater takes away the focus, and the vien between the eyes stands out. Also could have used a bit noise reduction.</td>', 'A bit too saturated - the red sweater takes away the focus, and the vien between the eyes stands out. Also could have used a bit noise reduction.', '2011-11-23 06:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601687, 985029, 137576, '<td valign="top">my favourite, love the thought and the tone is beautiful 10</td>', 'my favourite, love the thought and the tone is beautiful 10', '2011-11-23 06:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601688, 984635, 137576, '<td valign="top">nice, maybe a little bright or to much skin softening but like the ethereal feel of it 8</td>', 'nice, maybe a little bright or to much skin softening but like the ethereal feel of it 8', '2011-11-23 07:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601692, 984694, 136704, '<td valign="top">Nice close crop and beautiful detail in the iris.<br/> <br/>Not too fond of selective color, but here it works ok I guess. Would have loved if you took away some of the red (now gray) streaks in the white of the eyes. Also, a bit smoothing of the skin around the eyes would keep focus on the eye itself - my eyes wonder to the top and bottom right all the time...</td>', 'Nice close crop and beautiful detail in the iris. Not too fond of selective color, but here it works ok I guess. Would have loved if you took away some of the red (now gray) streaks in the white of the eyes. Also, a bit smoothing of the skin around the eyes would keep focus on the eye itself - my eyes wonder to the top and bottom right all the time...', '2011-11-23 07:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601694, 985153, 136704, '<td valign="top">Seems like the (photo) left brow is in focus.</td>', 'Seems like the (photo) left brow is in focus.', '2011-11-23 07:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601695, 985159, 136704, '<td valign="top">What I assume is a PP black line at the outskirts of the iris is a tad overdone. Same with the white in the eyes.<br/> <br/>Great lightning on the hair (the real subject).</td>', 'What I assume is a PP black line at the outskirts of the iris is a tad overdone. Same with the white in the eyes. Great lightning on the hair (the real subject).', '2011-11-23 07:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601697, 985160, 136704, '<td valign="top">Since I made a promise, that I wouldn''t comment without giving both pros AND cons, here goes:<br/> <br/>What makes this photo so great is the "cleanness" of everything - it seems cold and sterile, while the subject (a partly naked female body) is usually portrayed completely differently. Perfect! Not to mention the lighting, crop, sharpness, skin-texture ect...<br/> <br/>I see a few things that I would''ve liked you to change:<br/> <br/>- The stray hairs in the back of the neck. Hell of a job, but I guess just removing some of it would help<br/>-  The two black lines in the background going from top right towards the neck. I''m guessing the cloth / paper / whatever had some folds in it?</td>', 'Since I made a promise, that I wouldn''t comment without giving both pros AND cons, here goes: What makes this photo so great is the "cleanness" of everything - it seems cold and sterile, while the subject (a partly naked female body) is usually portrayed completely differently. Perfect! Not to mention the lighting, crop, sharpness, skin-texture ect... I see a few things that I would''ve liked you to change: - The stray hairs in the back of the neck. Hell of a job, but I guess just removing some of it would help-  The two black lines in the background going from top right towards the neck. I''m guessing the cloth / paper / whatever had some folds in it?', '2011-11-23 07:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
