(6601752, 984443, 136989, '<td valign="top">The "pout" almost looks like an afterthought in the frame given its placement.</td>', 'The "pout" almost looks like an afterthought in the frame given its placement.', '2011-11-23 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601753, 984995, 136989, '<td valign="top">There are a few dark spots that seem to compete for my attention in trying to focus on the eyes.  Even given the artistic approach I want to be drawn to the feature in question.</td>', 'There are a few dark spots that seem to compete for my attention in trying to focus on the eyes.  Even given the artistic approach I want to be drawn to the feature in question.', '2011-11-23 09:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601754, 984861, 136989, '<td valign="top">The guitar seems focal for me rather than the full sleeve.  A good capture still.</td>', 'The guitar seems focal for me rather than the full sleeve.  A good capture still.', '2011-11-23 09:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601755, 985034, 136989, '<td valign="top">The hand is out of focus and way bright.  As the defining feature I wanted to see more detail there rather than the background.</td>', 'The hand is out of focus and way bright.  As the defining feature I wanted to see more detail there rather than the background.', '2011-11-23 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601756, 984591, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I am missing the tie in with curiosity and the legs. As the defining feature the legs aren''t very prominent in picture.</td>', 'Nice shot but I am missing the tie in with curiosity and the legs. As the defining feature the legs aren''t very prominent in picture.', '2011-11-23 09:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601757, 985163, 136989, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the grain.  I think it takes away from the impact.</td>', 'Not fond of the grain.  I think it takes away from the impact.', '2011-11-23 09:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601759, 985161, 136989, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit busy.  I like the focus on the reflected text but I''m torn around how it blurs the eye itself.</td>', 'Seems a bit busy.  I like the focus on the reflected text but I''m torn around how it blurs the eye itself.', '2011-11-23 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601761, 985119, 136989, '<td valign="top">It looks like there''s a jacket collar obscuring the smile? Hard to tell.</td>', 'It looks like there''s a jacket collar obscuring the smile? Hard to tell.', '2011-11-23 09:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601763, 984303, 136989, '<td valign="top">Creative idea but it''s not really working for me.  The dark shadow in the foreground competes for my eye given all the silhouettes.  The hat brim (?) kinda works as a nose though.</td>', 'Creative idea but it''s not really working for me.  The dark shadow in the foreground competes for my eye given all the silhouettes.  The hat brim (?) kinda works as a nose though.', '2011-11-23 09:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601764, 985178, 136989, '<td valign="top">A little lightening of the shadows on the face may have helped here.  I want to see if she''s patiently waiting or irritated.  :)</td>', 'A little lightening of the shadows on the face may have helped here.  I want to see if she''s patiently waiting or irritated.  :)', '2011-11-23 09:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601768, 985126, 136989, '<td valign="top">Definitely attitude.  I like the nice ride in the background to accentuate.</td>', 'Definitely attitude.  I like the nice ride in the background to accentuate.', '2011-11-23 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601770, 984970, 136989, '<td valign="top">Colorful and captivating.  I like it!  The shadow at the neck makes her head look a bit like it''s floating though.</td>', 'Colorful and captivating.  I like it!  The shadow at the neck makes her head look a bit like it''s floating though.', '2011-11-23 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601771, 985087, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Terrific colors and highlights in the eyes.  I love how there are details in the hat but at the brim the focus is lost so that you jump back to the eyes.</td>', 'Very cute.  Terrific colors and highlights in the eyes.  I love how there are details in the hat but at the brim the focus is lost so that you jump back to the eyes.', '2011-11-23 09:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
