(6602111, 985178, 46918, '<td valign="top">too dark for my tastes</td>', 'too dark for my tastes', '2011-11-23 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602117, 984591, 132251, '<td valign="top">uh oh... Dude you are going to get DQ''d for the "Justin Carter" Watermark...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=136547" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Coldplay</a> It removes the anonymity also...</td>', 'uh oh... Dude you are going to get DQ''d for the "Justin Carter" Watermark... Coldplay It removes the anonymity also...', '2011-11-23 13:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602122, 985069, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the connection to the title from this image, it also doesn''t appear to me to portray a defining feature of any sort. Not keen on the softglow-style light either, generally the shot doesn''t appeal to me personally at all.</td>', 'I don''t see the connection to the title from this image, it also doesn''t appear to me to portray a defining feature of any sort. Not keen on the softglow-style light either, generally the shot doesn''t appeal to me personally at all.', '2011-11-23 13:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602126, 985130, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can''t see this having been taken under a yellow street light or anything since it''s clearly daylight, so I think you''ve maybe bumped the yellow saturation up majorly to highlight the colour of his hair? Unfortunately it''s also caused a weirdo yellow light on his nose and a few other patches on his face, which is really distracting. Great focus on the hair but the odd colouring kinda spoils the image for me.</td>', 'I can''t see this having been taken under a yellow street light or anything since it''s clearly daylight, so I think you''ve maybe bumped the yellow saturation up majorly to highlight the colour of his hair? Unfortunately it''s also caused a weirdo yellow light on his nose and a few other patches on his face, which is really distracting. Great focus on the hair but the odd colouring kinda spoils the image for me.', '2011-11-23 13:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602130, 985163, 94265, '<td valign="top">A cute idea for a pic of a clearly fun-spirited child but the processing kills it for me (assuming it''s processing, might just be a low quality photograph.) Far, far too noisy, lacks any kind of punch.</td>', 'A cute idea for a pic of a clearly fun-spirited child but the processing kills it for me (assuming it''s processing, might just be a low quality photograph.) Far, far too noisy, lacks any kind of punch.', '2011-11-23 14:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602131, 985173, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not too keen on the soft halo around her top but otherwise a lovely portrait, she looks like a nice person, it made me smile.</td>', 'Not too keen on the soft halo around her top but otherwise a lovely portrait, she looks like a nice person, it made me smile.', '2011-11-23 14:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602132, 985160, 94265, '<td valign="top">That crease or shadow on the right grabs my attention unfortunately. The area of brighter light at her throat also distracts from the entireity of the shot of her neck. Otherwise, it''s a nice portrait of a pretty model and I do quite like it.</td>', 'That crease or shadow on the right grabs my attention unfortunately. The area of brighter light at her throat also distracts from the entireity of the shot of her neck. Otherwise, it''s a nice portrait of a pretty model and I do quite like it.', '2011-11-23 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602133, 984768, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wish he was laughing as it would match the title better and he looks like he''d have a big jolly laugh; unless the title is meant to be sarcastic, in which case the image works fine, lol. Great sharp focus on it either way.</td>', 'I wish he was laughing as it would match the title better and he looks like he''d have a big jolly laugh; unless the title is meant to be sarcastic, in which case the image works fine, lol. Great sharp focus on it either way.', '2011-11-23 14:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602134, 985104, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s an impressive macro, especially considering the subject is yourself but I have to say, the close-up details of an eyeball really freak me out with all the little blood vessels and things. Aesthetically, such detail makes me not want to view the image again.</td>', 'It''s an impressive macro, especially considering the subject is yourself but I have to say, the close-up details of an eyeball really freak me out with all the little blood vessels and things. Aesthetically, such detail makes me not want to view the image again.', '2011-11-23 14:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602137, 985072, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get this one, the person''s hand has nothing ''apple'' about it. Seems like a title meant to be clever because there''s an apple product in the shot but it doesn''t actually fit at all. Overall, a little grainy and could do with being brightened up a bit.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get this one, the person''s hand has nothing ''apple'' about it. Seems like a title meant to be clever because there''s an apple product in the shot but it doesn''t actually fit at all. Overall, a little grainy and could do with being brightened up a bit.', '2011-11-23 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602138, 984630, 94265, '<td valign="top">Could have been an interesting shot of a face with character, shame it''s out of focus, I think it would have been Ok in focus and sharpened up, maybe in b&amp;w as well so we could focus on the lines and textures.</td>', 'Could have been an interesting shot of a face with character, shame it''s out of focus, I think it would have been Ok in focus and sharpened up, maybe in b&w as well so we could focus on the lines and textures.', '2011-11-23 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602139, 984979, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the processing, it looks almost like a painting filter at some parts. Very cute little dog though.</td>', 'Not sure I like the processing, it looks almost like a painting filter at some parts. Very cute little dog though.', '2011-11-23 14:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602140, 984840, 94265, '<td valign="top">I assume your meaning is that she is a focused person? Without the title I would never tell what defining feature you''re trying to portray. It''s a good enough portrait, her eyes are sharp and it''s nicely lit, although that single green earring kind of draws my eye a bit.</td>', 'I assume your meaning is that she is a focused person? Without the title I would never tell what defining feature you''re trying to portray. It''s a good enough portrait, her eyes are sharp and it''s nicely lit, although that single green earring kind of draws my eye a bit.', '2011-11-23 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602141, 985070, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit flat, I''d have boosted the levels; the colours could also do with being raised a little to help make the image pop a bit more. Nice smiley shot though.</td>', 'The light is a bit flat, I''d have boosted the levels; the colours could also do with being raised a little to help make the image pop a bit more. Nice smiley shot though.', '2011-11-23 14:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602143, 984726, 94265, '<td valign="top">This kinda looks like a snapshot of some friends going to a punk rock club, albeit good for a snapshot. The guy in the background there enhances that snappy feel and also feels like maybe not much thought has gone into composition. I''d personally have much rather seen a singular shot of one of them (maybe under some moody lighting to suit their look) with the main focal point on the hair.</td>', 'This kinda looks like a snapshot of some friends going to a punk rock club, albeit good for a snapshot. The guy in the background there enhances that snappy feel and also feels like maybe not much thought has gone into composition. I''d personally have much rather seen a singular shot of one of them (maybe under some moody lighting to suit their look) with the main focal point on the hair.', '2011-11-23 14:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602144, 985005, 94265, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better shot from the other side so we could see her expression, as it is there isn''t any connection between her and the viewer. The downward angle is fine but we can''t even see feet or anything at all of her to help viwers connect with the shot, it could be a coat around a pointy rock for all we know, lol. Nice focus on the coat though and I like the title.</td>', 'This would have been so much better shot from the other side so we could see her expression, as it is there isn''t any connection between her and the viewer. The downward angle is fine but we can''t even see feet or anything at all of her to help viwers connect with the shot, it could be a coat around a pointy rock for all we know, lol. Nice focus on the coat though and I like the title.', '2011-11-23 14:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602145, 984828, 94265, '<td valign="top">The challenge did say a PERSON''s defining feature so I imagine you''re taking some flak for this one. It is a generally nice pic of a very beautiful cat, although the blown-out window frame is a bit eye-grabbing. Shooting him through the glass has made the focus a little bit less sharp than it could have been.</td>', 'The challenge did say a PERSON''s defining feature so I imagine you''re taking some flak for this one. It is a generally nice pic of a very beautiful cat, although the blown-out window frame is a bit eye-grabbing. Shooting him through the glass has made the focus a little bit less sharp than it could have been.', '2011-11-23 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602146, 985175, 94265, '<td valign="top">The lighting has caused the line of the left side of her nose to almost disappear and blend into her face which is a shame, as otherwise this is a really pretty portrait with nice focus on the bold lips (looks like a proper make-up artist might have been at work here?) Since this is an advanced editing challenge, I''d have suggested you burned back in the nose line very delicately.</td>', 'The lighting has caused the line of the left side of her nose to almost disappear and blend into her face which is a shame, as otherwise this is a really pretty portrait with nice focus on the bold lips (looks like a proper make-up artist might have been at work here?) Since this is an advanced editing challenge, I''d have suggested you burned back in the nose line very delicately.', '2011-11-23 14:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602148, 984867, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image. Too bad it doesn''t meet the challenge description at all.</td>', 'What a wonderful image. Too bad it doesn''t meet the challenge description at all.', '2011-11-23 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602168, 985144, 139308, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2011-11-23 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602180, 985166, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of sepia but this is very sweet.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of sepia but this is very sweet.', '2011-11-23 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602181, 985159, 94265, '<td valign="top">Simple and classic, a very nice portrait. The colour of her hair really stands out, as does the green in her eyes, although the whites of the eyes look a little over-whitened. One other little niggle would be that her necklace has turned around and is only showing the clip.</td>', 'Simple and classic, a very nice portrait. The colour of her hair really stands out, as does the green in her eyes, although the whites of the eyes look a little over-whitened. One other little niggle would be that her necklace has turned around and is only showing the clip.', '2011-11-23 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602182, 984967, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice friendly eyes and smile, good focus too. A few artifacts appearing on his shirt though, possibly from compression? Apart from those, I quite like this simple, natural image.</td>', 'Nice friendly eyes and smile, good focus too. A few artifacts appearing on his shirt though, possibly from compression? Apart from those, I quite like this simple, natural image.', '2011-11-23 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602183, 984718, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not really feeling the colour popping here (just personal preference, I don''t care for selectively coloured eye images) but my main issue with this is the dark shadow under her nose; it''s not flattering on her and totally grabs my eye.</td>', 'Not really feeling the colour popping here (just personal preference, I don''t care for selectively coloured eye images) but my main issue with this is the dark shadow under her nose; it''s not flattering on her and totally grabs my eye.', '2011-11-23 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602184, 984867, 94265, '<td valign="top">The challenge calls for a person''s defining feature, this is not a person or even a living thing; I wouldn''d count this one as fitting the challenge, even though it''s a pretty shot.</td>', 'The challenge calls for a person''s defining feature, this is not a person or even a living thing; I wouldn''d count this one as fitting the challenge, even though it''s a pretty shot.', '2011-11-23 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602186, 984660, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a wickedly brilliant expression, haha. Nice focus, very cute; the wee red blemish by his eyebrow kinds of draws my attention, I might have cloned that out.</td>', 'What a wickedly brilliant expression, haha. Nice focus, very cute; the wee red blemish by his eyebrow kinds of draws my attention, I might have cloned that out.', '2011-11-23 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602187, 985106, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the soft haziness around the fingers, or the square crop (personal taste) but the shot is in nice focus, it shows interesting skin patterns and textures, very characteristic of a man who has worked with his hands for a long time.</td>', 'I don''t care for the soft haziness around the fingers, or the square crop (personal taste) but the shot is in nice focus, it shows interesting skin patterns and textures, very characteristic of a man who has worked with his hands for a long time.', '2011-11-23 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602188, 984635, 94265, '<td valign="top">While I don''t feel this image portrays what the title says about her, it''s a very pretty portrait, nice focus on her face and an almost tender smile. I''d have actually been inclined to call this entry ''Tender'' as I could see the connection there.</td>', 'While I don''t feel this image portrays what the title says about her, it''s a very pretty portrait, nice focus on her face and an almost tender smile. I''d have actually been inclined to call this entry ''Tender'' as I could see the connection there.', '2011-11-23 14:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602189, 985077, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a little soft but it kinda suits the image. That area of jet blackness under her chin totally pulls my eye in away from her face though, might have been better to include a light source aimed upwards, or to just have placed her in stronger light so we could see some detail down there.</td>', 'This is a little soft but it kinda suits the image. That area of jet blackness under her chin totally pulls my eye in away from her face though, might have been better to include a light source aimed upwards, or to just have placed her in stronger light so we could see some detail down there.', '2011-11-23 14:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602190, 985002, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Cavalier and in nice focus, although I don''t see a connection to this challenge in either the title or the shot itself.</td>', 'Beautiful Cavalier and in nice focus, although I don''t see a connection to this challenge in either the title or the shot itself.', '2011-11-23 14:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602201, 984666, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked this better after a little denoising and a straightening of that horizon line but it''s nice and sharp, plus very cute. Love the owl hat!</td>', 'I''d have liked this better after a little denoising and a straightening of that horizon line but it''s nice and sharp, plus very cute. Love the owl hat!', '2011-11-23 14:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602202, 985144, 94265, '<td valign="top">This view is a bit too close to the subject, feels a bit cramped. The highlights are too bright on one shoulder and her upper face as well, plus the focus could be sharper. It''s a bit noisy overall. This shot would have been helped by moving further away from her, either lowering the ISO to eradicate that white-out skin glare or upping the shutter for the same reason (which could have also helped with the focus) and denoising a little once the image was transfered to your computer.</td>', 'This view is a bit too close to the subject, feels a bit cramped. The highlights are too bright on one shoulder and her upper face as well, plus the focus could be sharper. It''s a bit noisy overall. This shot would have been helped by moving further away from her, either lowering the ISO to eradicate that white-out skin glare or upping the shutter for the same reason (which could have also helped with the focus) and denoising a little once the image was transfered to your computer.', '2011-11-23 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602203, 985053, 94265, '<td valign="top">As a matter of personal preference, I hate smoking shots but this seems to fit the challenge, plus the focus and exposure are great. His face is a bit obscured by the smoke but not too badly.</td>', 'As a matter of personal preference, I hate smoking shots but this seems to fit the challenge, plus the focus and exposure are great. His face is a bit obscured by the smoke but not too badly.', '2011-11-23 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602207, 985065, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the DOF on this one, it does seem to me to be a bit sharper on the material of his back than his face but that''s Ok as the shot still works quite well. I don''t like the border though, I can see why you''d go for that colour for framing the image but plain black or none at all would have worked better for me personally.</td>', 'I like the colours and the DOF on this one, it does seem to me to be a bit sharper on the material of his back than his face but that''s Ok as the shot still works quite well. I don''t like the border though, I can see why you''d go for that colour for framing the image but plain black or none at all would have worked better for me personally.', '2011-11-23 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602209, 984861, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, nice colours going on and good focus. Would''ve liked to see it cropped a bit further out though so as to keep in his full right hand and the head of the guitar.</td>', 'Pretty cool, nice colours going on and good focus. Would''ve liked to see it cropped a bit further out though so as to keep in his full right hand and the head of the guitar.', '2011-11-23 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602212, 985035, 94265, '<td valign="top">This will probably do very well. Nice focus and sharpness, a pretty girl. Highlights are a bit bright in the background and on the hat for me but it''s not lost too much detail so it''s Ok. Very nice overall.</td>', 'This will probably do very well. Nice focus and sharpness, a pretty girl. Highlights are a bit bright in the background and on the hat for me but it''s not lost too much detail so it''s Ok. Very nice overall.', '2011-11-23 15:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602219, 985160, 49018, '<td valign="top">Really effective toning.</td>', 'Really effective toning.', '2011-11-23 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602221, 984683, 94265, '<td valign="top">Outstanding DOF and focus, great composition too. His eyes look a little over-whitened to me, not sure if you did anything to them? Otherwise, I really like this.</td>', 'Outstanding DOF and focus, great composition too. His eyes look a little over-whitened to me, not sure if you did anything to them? Otherwise, I really like this.', '2011-11-23 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602231, 985126, 94265, '<td valign="top">You did capture a great look of attitude here, the underground car park was the perfect setting for a shot like this. Nice focus on her face too. Good job :-)</td>', 'You did capture a great look of attitude here, the underground car park was the perfect setting for a shot like this. Nice focus on her face too. Good job :-)', '2011-11-23 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602232, 984591, 94265, '<td valign="top">How can legs be curious....? I don''t really care for the title and this looks to me like a candid shot of someone in the street, not a defining feature shot of someone. The shot is Ok generally although that watermark right in the middle there kills the whole thing for me, it''s personal taste but I can''t bear intrusive watermarks.</td>', 'How can legs be curious....? I don''t really care for the title and this looks to me like a candid shot of someone in the street, not a defining feature shot of someone. The shot is Ok generally although that watermark right in the middle there kills the whole thing for me, it''s personal taste but I can''t bear intrusive watermarks.', '2011-11-23 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602233, 984970, 94265, '<td valign="top">Highlights are a bit too bright on the nose and forehead but I still like this shot. Would look good in a model''s portfolio; fantastic outfit, all the colours compliment each other and the focus is great. Background is a little noisy, I''d have cloned out the white speck in the top left corner and maybe burned the right side a bit to help mask that shape (lens flare?)</td>', 'Highlights are a bit too bright on the nose and forehead but I still like this shot. Would look good in a model''s portfolio; fantastic outfit, all the colours compliment each other and the focus is great. Background is a little noisy, I''d have cloned out the white speck in the top left corner and maybe burned the right side a bit to help mask that shape (lens flare?)', '2011-11-23 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602234, 985167, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, the lighting is Ok, nice focus on his fingers. Not particularly exciting (especially with the muted colours) but generally quite nice.</td>', 'Good DOF, the lighting is Ok, nice focus on his fingers. Not particularly exciting (especially with the muted colours) but generally quite nice.', '2011-11-23 15:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602235, 985136, 94265, '<td valign="top">The yellow saturation is up a little high, it might enhance the colour of the hat but it also gives a weird yellow tinge behind his ear. Great sharp focus though, an interesting character, looks like a real country fan. :-)</td>', 'The yellow saturation is up a little high, it might enhance the colour of the hat but it also gives a weird yellow tinge behind his ear. Great sharp focus though, an interesting character, looks like a real country fan. :-)', '2011-11-23 15:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602237, 984635, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good portrait and very pleasant postprocessing.</td>', 'Good portrait and very pleasant postprocessing.', '2011-11-23 15:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602244, 984846, 49018, '<td valign="top">Extremely pleasant toning and interesting angle.</td>', 'Extremely pleasant toning and interesting angle.', '2011-11-23 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602245, 985161, 49018, '<td valign="top">Eyes seems to be a very popular subject in this challenge, but this take is definetely interesting and out of the box.</td>', 'Eyes seems to be a very popular subject in this challenge, but this take is definetely interesting and out of the box.', '2011-11-23 15:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602247, 984970, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very competent lighting, I like the choice to leave the neck in shadow.</td>', 'Very competent lighting, I like the choice to leave the neck in shadow.', '2011-11-23 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602249, 985053, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, quite personal. I like the colour rendition but I am wondering how this would look in low contrast BW.</td>', 'Nice portrait, quite personal. I like the colour rendition but I am wondering how this would look in low contrast BW.', '2011-11-23 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602253, 984591, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and well framed. Would have liked a shallower dof but that''s my taste. I think the copyright note might lead to DQ though.</td>', 'Interesting photo and well framed. Would have liked a shallower dof but that''s my taste. I think the copyright note might lead to DQ though.', '2011-11-23 15:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602254, 984303, 49018, '<td valign="top">So funny :) Very well captured.</td>', 'So funny :) Very well captured.', '2011-11-23 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602256, 985034, 49018, '<td valign="top">Amusing and well captured.</td>', 'Amusing and well captured.', '2011-11-23 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602257, 985176, 49018, '<td valign="top">Funny and well posed. Personally I would have found more effective an higher crop, just under the nose or under the eyes, still leaving quite  a lot of negative space over the head.<br/>But that''s just me I guess.</td>', 'Funny and well posed. Personally I would have found more effective an higher crop, just under the nose or under the eyes, still leaving quite  a lot of negative space over the head.But that''s just me I guess.', '2011-11-23 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602262, 984683, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very effective and well captured, DOF is just right to show the features of the passers-by. Between curly hair, facial features and slightly unkempt look, there are surely enough defining features to make him very evident in an asian country. If it''s not Asia, hats down for finding not just the right protagonist but the right extras too. The eyes are perhaps a bit too present and contrasty to my taste, but it might be just the way his eyes are, and anyway I am nitpicking. Excellent image.</td>', 'Very effective and well captured, DOF is just right to show the features of the passers-by. Between curly hair, facial features and slightly unkempt look, there are surely enough defining features to make him very evident in an asian country. If it''s not Asia, hats down for finding not just the right protagonist but the right extras too. The eyes are perhaps a bit too present and contrasty to my taste, but it might be just the way his eyes are, and anyway I am nitpicking. Excellent image.', '2011-11-23 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602263, 984843, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very expressive.</td>', 'Very expressive.', '2011-11-23 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602264, 985163, 49018, '<td valign="top">Definetely funny, I like the vintage post-processing.</td>', 'Definetely funny, I like the vintage post-processing.', '2011-11-23 16:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602266, 985130, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and framing. Works well with a quite angular face. The light is great in creating highlights on his hair, but perhaps also causes him to squint a bit too much. In a sense this might be good, as the eyes do not compete with the hair for attention. Some fill light on the left could have made for a more even toning. Good image.</td>', 'Interesting angle and framing. Works well with a quite angular face. The light is great in creating highlights on his hair, but perhaps also causes him to squint a bit too much. In a sense this might be good, as the eyes do not compete with the hair for attention. Some fill light on the left could have made for a more even toning. Good image.', '2011-11-23 16:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602268, 984694, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well framed. I am uncertain about the high contrast in the skin and eyelashes, perhaps a softer look would have given even more prominence to the eye. But that''s just my taste.</td>', 'Nice idea and well framed. I am uncertain about the high contrast in the skin and eyelashes, perhaps a softer look would have given even more prominence to the eye. But that''s just my taste.', '2011-11-23 16:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602269, 985144, 49018, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose and toning, very classical. Low contrast works very well here.</td>', 'Wonderful pose and toning, very classical. Low contrast works very well here.', '2011-11-23 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602270, 985005, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. More widespread destruction would have strenghtened the concept. I am not sure I would have got it without reading the title.</td>', 'Nice idea. More widespread destruction would have strenghtened the concept. I am not sure I would have got it without reading the title.', '2011-11-23 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602271, 985026, 49018, '<td valign="top">This is just fascinating and indeed a real glimpse into not just a personality but also another age entirely. The only thing is that, even understanding spanish, I could have not guessed what the notes precisely were withut the title. But I feel it''s more a cultural and knowledge barrier than a defect of the photograph. 10 of course.</td>', 'This is just fascinating and indeed a real glimpse into not just a personality but also another age entirely. The only thing is that, even understanding spanish, I could have not guessed what the notes precisely were withut the title. But I feel it''s more a cultural and knowledge barrier than a defect of the photograph. 10 of course.', '2011-11-23 16:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602273, 985125, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the framing and the subjects. I am a bit unsure about the postprocessing. Blurring elements to make the rest more prominent is just fine and I see the point in keeping the faces in perfect focus. However, blurring the area between them looks that point very unnatural. However, I see how this, along with grittiness and very coarse application of blur, could be a creative decision.</td>', 'I like the idea, the framing and the subjects. I am a bit unsure about the postprocessing. Blurring elements to make the rest more prominent is just fine and I see the point in keeping the faces in perfect focus. However, blurring the area between them looks that point very unnatural. However, I see how this, along with grittiness and very coarse application of blur, could be a creative decision.', '2011-11-23 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
