(6602711, 985125, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes on both of them - they look relaxed but focused. That''s what good theater is all about, I guess. Well done.</td>', 'Love the eyes on both of them - they look relaxed but focused. That''s what good theater is all about, I guess. Well done.', '2011-11-24 12:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602712, 985002, 100831, '<td valign="top">adorable!</td>', 'adorable!', '2011-11-24 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602713, 985176, 100831, '<td valign="top">interesting composition.</td>', 'interesting composition.', '2011-11-24 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602717, 984995, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like a pen and ink drawing that was dropped in water.  I like the way the tones transition from one another.</td>', 'This looks like a pen and ink drawing that was dropped in water.  I like the way the tones transition from one another.', '2011-11-24 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602720, 984957, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this had a touch more contrast to bring out the texture of her hair and skin.  I also wonder if this might have been stronger in black and white.</td>', 'I wish this had a touch more contrast to bring out the texture of her hair and skin.  I also wonder if this might have been stronger in black and white.', '2011-11-24 12:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602722, 985167, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background and the title match.  The mundane locale breaks the suspension of disbelief when the word "magical" is used.  I think a different background, some side lighting, and maybe some flare would have given more of a "magical" atmosphere, or even just an atmosphere that is more representative of beautiful music.</td>', 'I don''t think the background and the title match.  The mundane locale breaks the suspension of disbelief when the word "magical" is used.  I think a different background, some side lighting, and maybe some flare would have given more of a "magical" atmosphere, or even just an atmosphere that is more representative of beautiful music.', '2011-11-24 12:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602723, 985106, 47470, '<td valign="top">Something about the lighting, the color, and the OOF fingertips makes me picture autumn.  But when I read the title, I could definitely see rough Atlantic weather and big sails made taut by a damp breeze.  Very good job at conveying all of that!</td>', 'Something about the lighting, the color, and the OOF fingertips makes me picture autumn.  But when I read the title, I could definitely see rough Atlantic weather and big sails made taut by a damp breeze.  Very good job at conveying all of that!', '2011-11-24 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602726, 985144, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think a bit of sharpening could have really helped this image.  I also don''t like that the corner of the room awkwardly touches her forehead and chin.</td>', 'I think a bit of sharpening could have really helped this image.  I also don''t like that the corner of the room awkwardly touches her forehead and chin.', '2011-11-24 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602728, 985029, 47470, '<td valign="top">The tonality and composition of this is really well done.</td>', 'The tonality and composition of this is really well done.', '2011-11-24 13:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602729, 985053, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the eye closest to the view is obscured.  I think you could have cropped a bit closer to make the pipe more prominent in the frame.</td>', 'I don''t like that the eye closest to the view is obscured.  I think you could have cropped a bit closer to make the pipe more prominent in the frame.', '2011-11-24 13:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602730, 985125, 47470, '<td valign="top">Parts of the image look artificially blurred and parts have a lot of artifacting that looks like it was exaggerated during post-processing.  Maybe the exaggeration was accidental, but if it wasn''t, I can''t see how it improves the image.</td>', 'Parts of the image look artificially blurred and parts have a lot of artifacting that looks like it was exaggerated during post-processing.  Maybe the exaggeration was accidental, but if it wasn''t, I can''t see how it improves the image.', '2011-11-24 13:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602731, 984659, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the crop of this.</td>', 'I love the color and the crop of this.', '2011-11-24 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602732, 985120, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this a little brighter, maybe with a hint of a rim light from the right so that the hands so blend into the background.  I think the child''s hand isn''t represented enough in this.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this a little brighter, maybe with a hint of a rim light from the right so that the hands so blend into the background.  I think the child''s hand isn''t represented enough in this.', '2011-11-24 13:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602773, 984995, 12611, '<td valign="top">Really good. The verticals and soft contrast points work beautifully.</td>', 'Really good. The verticals and soft contrast points work beautifully.', '2011-11-24 16:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602774, 985159, 12611, '<td valign="top">Erin go bragh! Great lighting.</td>', 'Erin go bragh! Great lighting.', '2011-11-24 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602813, 984970, 91783, '<td valign="top">this is really nice, but i would watch out for wordrobe issues. her eyelash is coming off. i suppose you cant do anything about it now, but i find that detail distracting... I think you have dust on your sensor too... you might want to clean that asap.<br/> <br/>Anywas, nice lighting, great colors! good luck :)</td>', 'this is really nice, but i would watch out for wordrobe issues. her eyelash is coming off. i suppose you cant do anything about it now, but i find that detail distracting... I think you have dust on your sensor too... you might want to clean that asap. Anywas, nice lighting, great colors! good luck :)', '2011-11-24 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602817, 985153, 91783, '<td valign="top">i''m thinking this is ken :) if not. appologies... <br/> <br/>lol i like this. it has humor, colors i like. the crop is nice too.</td>', 'i''m thinking this is ken :) if not. appologies...  lol i like this. it has humor, colors i like. the crop is nice too.', '2011-11-24 17:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602856, 985122, 41129, '<td valign="top">:) , shot works so well in b/w</td>', ':) , shot works so well in b/w', '2011-11-24 19:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602858, 984867, 41129, '<td valign="top">nice enough photo but WTF?? lol.. "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature. Find someone, find what defines them, take a picture of it. " .. hmm DNMC me thinks</td>', 'nice enough photo but WTF?? lol.. "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature. Find someone, find what defines them, take a picture of it. " .. hmm DNMC me thinks', '2011-11-24 19:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602860, 984979, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on the dogs face...That is one of those things that can not be reproduced.</td>', 'I love the expression on the dogs face...That is one of those things that can not be reproduced.', '2011-11-24 19:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602861, 985002, 41129, '<td valign="top">having an animal in your shot is one thing.. forgetting to include the human who''s defining feature you are portraying is quite another.. lol. challenge clearly stated to find someone and take a picture of <i>their </i>defining feature..DNMC.. cute dog though.</td>', 'having an animal in your shot is one thing.. forgetting to include the human who''s defining feature you are portraying is quite another.. lol. challenge clearly stated to find someone and take a picture of their defining feature..DNMC.. cute dog though.', '2011-11-24 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602866, 984846, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is more a shot of eyelashes than the actual eyes, perhaps it should have been titled as such, since some people might consider long eyelashes a defining feature. I don''t mind the perspective but it''s far too noisy for me.</td>', 'This is more a shot of eyelashes than the actual eyes, perhaps it should have been titled as such, since some people might consider long eyelashes a defining feature. I don''t mind the perspective but it''s far too noisy for me.', '2011-11-24 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602867, 985072, 41129, '<td valign="top">sorry, if this is a clever idea then its clearly lost on me.. and the photo is just more than a little uninteresting.. sorry</td>', 'sorry, if this is a clever idea then its clearly lost on me.. and the photo is just more than a little uninteresting.. sorry', '2011-11-24 19:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602870, 984312, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you''ve cropped her so far to the right to show off the blown bits of the dandelion clock? Unfortunately there are none as it appears she hasn''t blown it yet! Or if she has, the b&amp;w conversion has lost that detail in the busy bokeh in the background. Since the space to the left is moot, I''d have prefered to see a further out shot of her holding the flower, maybe in an outdoorsy nature kind of outfit like a floral dress showing her sitting in the grass, to get more of a natural feel.</td>', 'I''m guessing you''ve cropped her so far to the right to show off the blown bits of the dandelion clock? Unfortunately there are none as it appears she hasn''t blown it yet! Or if she has, the b&w conversion has lost that detail in the busy bokeh in the background. Since the space to the left is moot, I''d have prefered to see a further out shot of her holding the flower, maybe in an outdoorsy nature kind of outfit like a floral dress showing her sitting in the grass, to get more of a natural feel.', '2011-11-24 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602871, 985162, 41129, '<td valign="top">lights very harsh in places (yes its sunny but as photographers this is one of our many challenges for setting our cameras surely).. and i don''t like the chopped off foot at the bottom edge..</td>', 'lights very harsh in places (yes its sunny but as photographers this is one of our many challenges for setting our cameras surely).. and i don''t like the chopped off foot at the bottom edge..', '2011-11-24 20:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602873, 985144, 41129, '<td valign="top">she doesn''t look that broad to me... maybe a UK size 8 top at most ?? .. nice hair but very harsh lighting on her face and image is rather noisy looking.</td>', 'she doesn''t look that broad to me... maybe a UK size 8 top at most ?? .. nice hair but very harsh lighting on her face and image is rather noisy looking.', '2011-11-24 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602874, 984828, 30364, '<td valign="top">So good to see a pet portrait that''s so good!<br/> <br/>In my top ten, and an extra point for the satisfying use of a transcendent frame.</td>', 'So good to see a pet portrait that''s so good! In my top ten, and an extra point for the satisfying use of a transcendent frame.', '2011-11-24 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602875, 984995, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is almost like a photocopy of another low quality photocopy; insanely noisy, contrast is too dark, no point of focus, seemingly no real thought to composition and the apparent point of interest isn''t even really legible. I can just about make out a face but the quality of this image is so low I feel I can''t give higher than the minimum vote, sorry.</td>', 'This is almost like a photocopy of another low quality photocopy; insanely noisy, contrast is too dark, no point of focus, seemingly no real thought to composition and the apparent point of interest isn''t even really legible. I can just about make out a face but the quality of this image is so low I feel I can''t give higher than the minimum vote, sorry.', '2011-11-24 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602877, 984846, 41129, '<td valign="top">Trying to work out why you titled this "the eyes". If the eyes are this lady''s defining feature then why take this from an agle that only shows us her eyelashes and not her eyes ?? sure "Lovely Lashes" (or similar) might have fitted better ?? .. I mention this only because part of the challenge was to title your picture with the defining feature.. also i don''t like the high amount of noise.</td>', 'Trying to work out why you titled this "the eyes". If the eyes are this lady''s defining feature then why take this from an agle that only shows us her eyelashes and not her eyes ?? sure "Lovely Lashes" (or similar) might have fitted better ?? .. I mention this only because part of the challenge was to title your picture with the defining feature.. also i don''t like the high amount of noise.', '2011-11-24 20:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602878, 984828, 41129, '<td valign="top">yet another shot where theres an animal and no human.. the challenge was "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature. Find someone, find what defines them, take a picture of it." .. clearly a person has to be in the picture and THEIR defining feature portrayed.. this was one challenge description where thinking outside the box clearly still had to include a person.</td>', 'yet another shot where theres an animal and no human.. the challenge was "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature. Find someone, find what defines them, take a picture of it." .. clearly a person has to be in the picture and THEIR defining feature portrayed.. this was one challenge description where thinking outside the box clearly still had to include a person.', '2011-11-24 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602879, 985053, 41129, '<td valign="top">nice clear shot.. nicely done</td>', 'nice clear shot.. nicely done', '2011-11-24 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602880, 985175, 41129, '<td valign="top">not keen on the border but nice image :)</td>', 'not keen on the border but nice image :)', '2011-11-24 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602882, 985119, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is very hazy and much too close-in on the person (a little boy?) for the viewer to establish any kind of connection. Since your intent was to show his smile, this should have been a more brightly-taken facial shot. Lacks any point of interest as it stands, a low-scorer for me, sorry.</td>', 'This is very hazy and much too close-in on the person (a little boy?) for the viewer to establish any kind of connection. Since your intent was to show his smile, this should have been a more brightly-taken facial shot. Lacks any point of interest as it stands, a low-scorer for me, sorry.', '2011-11-24 20:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602884, 984630, 41129, '<td valign="top">very out of focus and too close in a crop.</td>', 'very out of focus and too close in a crop.', '2011-11-24 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602885, 985130, 41129, '<td valign="top">overexposed on the face in places,, technically a weird choice of angle and location to portray his ginger hair.. could have been done many ways far better.</td>', 'overexposed on the face in places,, technically a weird choice of angle and location to portray his ginger hair.. could have been done many ways far better.', '2011-11-24 20:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602886, 984694, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t find eye close-ups very interesting (just personally) but the focus is really good. Well done on not majorly oversaturating the selective colour as many people do on an edit of this style.</td>', 'I don''t find eye close-ups very interesting (just personally) but the focus is really good. Well done on not majorly oversaturating the selective colour as many people do on an edit of this style.', '2011-11-24 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602887, 984766, 41129, '<td valign="top">sorry but i don''t see how this picture shows us that he is a poet other than the title.. the same picture could be titled with any other pastime this person has and it would still fail to portray any of those either.. other than smoking that is..</td>', 'sorry but i don''t see how this picture shows us that he is a poet other than the title.. the same picture could be titled with any other pastime this person has and it would still fail to portray any of those either.. other than smoking that is..', '2011-11-24 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602890, 985162, 94265, '<td valign="top">The blown-out patches of skin from the sun catch my eye in this shot, as does the cropped off foot. The focus isn''t very strong either. I''d have liked to see this shot in different light as I think it could have been a nice portrait, although the photo doesn''t really portray what the title tells us, i.e looking at just the shot I''d have no idea what defining feature was being put across.</td>', 'The blown-out patches of skin from the sun catch my eye in this shot, as does the cropped off foot. The focus isn''t very strong either. I''d have liked to see this shot in different light as I think it could have been a nice portrait, although the photo doesn''t really portray what the title tells us, i.e looking at just the shot I''d have no idea what defining feature was being put across.', '2011-11-24 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6602891, 984970, 41129, '<td valign="top">lovely photo and model.. light is a tiny bit harsh on her nose and forehead but i still like it..</td>', 'lovely photo and model.. light is a tiny bit harsh on her nose and forehead but i still like it..', '2011-11-24 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1);
