(6603039, 984768, 30364, '<td valign="top">Irresistible top ten.  Thank you.</td>', 'Irresistible top ten.  Thank you.', '2011-11-25 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603040, 984767, 30364, '<td valign="top">The everyday hero as a fulcrum: he stands square, the world rotates in blissful nescience upon his shoulders. And still he cops it sweet.  Top three, and the Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The everyday hero as a fulcrum: he stands square, the world rotates in blissful nescience upon his shoulders. And still he cops it sweet.  Top three, and the Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.', '2011-11-25 01:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603042, 984979, 30364, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  You can have my personal <a href="//www.magnumphotos.com/c.aspx?VP=XSpecific_MAG.BookDetail_VPage&amp;pid=2K7O3RHWZ7EX" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Elliott Erwitt</a> award for this gem.  Top three and the consolation prize (versus the Erwitt) of an Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Brilliant.  You can have my personal Elliott Erwitt award for this gem.  Top three and the consolation prize (versus the Erwitt) of an Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.', '2011-11-25 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603044, 984784, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful, poetic photograph.  Indelible couplets and phrases; harmony, narrative, resolution and a quiet sense of order.  It''s a thing deeply considered and yet so economically expressed. <br/> <br/>My choice for Best in Show, plus (sorry for you) the DPC kiss of death: the Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Such a beautiful, poetic photograph.  Indelible couplets and phrases; harmony, narrative, resolution and a quiet sense of order.  It''s a thing deeply considered and yet so economically expressed.  My choice for Best in Show, plus (sorry for you) the DPC kiss of death: the Order of the Thumb.  Thank you.', '2011-11-25 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603087, 984957, 101668, '<td valign="top">You captured the wisdom nicely.</td>', 'You captured the wisdom nicely.', '2011-11-25 05:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603088, 985136, 101668, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and lighting good pp great</td>', 'Very crisp and lighting good pp great', '2011-11-25 05:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
