(6603100, 985026, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great testimony of Grandpa. Focus on the notes a little soft and the background bokeh very strong. Like the idea and composition</td>', 'Great testimony of Grandpa. Focus on the notes a little soft and the background bokeh very strong. Like the idea and composition', '2011-11-25 05:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
