(6603759, 985002, 101668, '<td valign="top">Sweetie pie with a warning glint in the eye. Lovely nose!</td>', 'Sweetie pie with a warning glint in the eye. Lovely nose!', '2011-11-26 03:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603761, 985035, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great shot and IMO contender for blue.</td>', 'Great shot and IMO contender for blue.', '2011-11-26 03:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603872, 984995, 124815, '<td valign="top">Like a charcoal drawing - beautifully integrated portrait in this exercise but the expression remains somehow random, due to the medium. I like a lot the contour of the head. I would have cropped half of the face (the man''s right eye) and left the right side with the background. <br/>In any case, I find this shot like a breath of fresh air in this challenge.</td>', 'Like a charcoal drawing - beautifully integrated portrait in this exercise but the expression remains somehow random, due to the medium. I like a lot the contour of the head. I would have cropped half of the face (the man''s right eye) and left the right side with the background. In any case, I find this shot like a breath of fresh air in this challenge.', '2011-11-26 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603873, 984768, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ah, le bonhomme!Lovely.</td>', 'Ah, le bonhomme!Lovely.', '2011-11-26 09:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603874, 985160, 124815, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2011-11-26 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603951, 985029, 138630, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and focus, well composed and framed, pleasing tones and light.  Nice one.</td>', 'Excellent detail and focus, well composed and framed, pleasing tones and light.  Nice one.', '2011-11-26 11:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603956, 985109, 138630, '<td valign="top">A lovely natural portrait, my favorite kind, well composed and with very nice light and tones.  Excellent job on the glasses, which can be so very hard to handle.  I do find the two flares on the right distracting.</td>', 'A lovely natural portrait, my favorite kind, well composed and with very nice light and tones.  Excellent job on the glasses, which can be so very hard to handle.  I do find the two flares on the right distracting.', '2011-11-26 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6603957, 985136, 138630, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail in both the hat and the face.  The hat stars as IMO is appropriate for this challenge, but the face is strong enough to balance it nicely.</td>', 'Excellent detail in both the hat and the face.  The hat stars as IMO is appropriate for this challenge, but the face is strong enough to balance it nicely.', '2011-11-26 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604025, 984660, 140777, '<td valign="top">Such a great photo! it makes me smile everytime I look at it :)</td>', 'Such a great photo! it makes me smile everytime I look at it :)', '2011-11-26 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604026, 985144, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful thick hair, I might add, and a very pretty profile.  I might not have included "broad back" in my title LOL  The image is softer than I would like to see it -- especially the hair should be very well defined, I think.  The grain helps but does not completely compensate for the blown out areas.  And I find the location of the corner in the background distracting.  It like this anyway.</td>', 'Beautiful thick hair, I might add, and a very pretty profile.  I might not have included "broad back" in my title LOL  The image is softer than I would like to see it -- especially the hair should be very well defined, I think.  The grain helps but does not completely compensate for the blown out areas.  And I find the location of the corner in the background distracting.  It like this anyway.', '2011-11-26 14:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604116, 984970, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighting and color -- right down to the blue eyebrows.  Funky and dramatic and I would say blue hair is definitely a defining feature.</td>', 'Terrific lighting and color -- right down to the blue eyebrows.  Funky and dramatic and I would say blue hair is definitely a defining feature.', '2011-11-26 20:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604184, 985175, 140470, '<td valign="top">I think this is over-edited.</td>', 'I think this is over-edited.', '2011-11-26 22:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604187, 984312, 140470, '<td valign="top">I wish you actually captured the stuff from the dandelion blowing in the wind.</td>', 'I wish you actually captured the stuff from the dandelion blowing in the wind.', '2011-11-26 23:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604190, 985122, 140470, '<td valign="top">I love the lines the profile of his face makes, as well as the shape of the mouse/hand. Good composition. I wish you took this against a different colored background, as it makes the image look muddy even though the actual subject is properly exposed..</td>', 'I love the lines the profile of his face makes, as well as the shape of the mouse/hand. Good composition. I wish you took this against a different colored background, as it makes the image look muddy even though the actual subject is properly exposed..', '2011-11-26 23:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604193, 985003, 140470, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and focus of the shot. I like being able to see the glare in his eye for some reason too..</td>', 'I love the angle and focus of the shot. I like being able to see the glare in his eye for some reason too..', '2011-11-26 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604199, 984443, 140470, '<td valign="top">Is it supposed to be this noisy?</td>', 'Is it supposed to be this noisy?', '2011-11-26 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604203, 984843, 140470, '<td valign="top">Seeing the blinds shadow is really annoying.</td>', 'Seeing the blinds shadow is really annoying.', '2011-11-26 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604226, 985007, 138630, '<td valign="top">What a fun looking young man!  The lighting is working for me on his hair, face and hands, not so much on his shoulders.  Good focus on the eyes and hair, too.</td>', 'What a fun looking young man!  The lighting is working for me on his hair, face and hands, not so much on his shoulders.  Good focus on the eyes and hair, too.', '2011-11-26 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604227, 985159, 138630, '<td valign="top">A very pretty young lady with beautiful hair and, I might add, eyes.  Very nice lighting and just the right touch of editing -- she still looks natural which I like a lot.</td>', 'A very pretty young lady with beautiful hair and, I might add, eyes.  Very nice lighting and just the right touch of editing -- she still looks natural which I like a lot.', '2011-11-26 23:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604229, 985119, 138630, '<td valign="top">I have to work way too hard to see the smile here.</td>', 'I have to work way too hard to see the smile here.', '2011-11-26 23:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604230, 985004, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity, the cleverness of one shoe on, one kicked off, the use of the shadows to repeat the lines and shapes, the fishnet stockings -- well planned and executed.</td>', 'I like the simplicity, the cleverness of one shoe on, one kicked off, the use of the shadows to repeat the lines and shapes, the fishnet stockings -- well planned and executed.', '2011-11-26 23:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604232, 984718, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the close crop and the direct gaze.  The lighting is a bit harsh -- I find the shadow below her nose especially dark.  I am not a fan of this kind of selective coloring which I know is very popular with many.</td>', 'I like the close crop and the direct gaze.  The lighting is a bit harsh -- I find the shadow below her nose especially dark.  I am not a fan of this kind of selective coloring which I know is very popular with many.', '2011-11-26 23:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604234, 984635, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and desaturated tones a lot, the expression is interesting.  It does not, however, speak to the title, IMO.  Character is very difficult to portray in an image.</td>', 'I like the lighting and desaturated tones a lot, the expression is interesting.  It does not, however, speak to the title, IMO.  Character is very difficult to portray in an image.', '2011-11-26 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604237, 984660, 138630, '<td valign="top">A very cute lopsided smile and expression for sure.  Gotta love that raised eyebrow.  I would have liked this one better if he had been making eye contact with the viewer, I think.</td>', 'A very cute lopsided smile and expression for sure.  Gotta love that raised eyebrow.  I would have liked this one better if he had been making eye contact with the viewer, I think.', '2011-11-27 00:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604239, 985176, 138630, '<td valign="top">Well, he certainly knows how to work them -- and fine, thick brows they are at that.  There''s too much space over his head for me -- the framing and composition just aren''t working.</td>', 'Well, he certainly knows how to work them -- and fine, thick brows they are at that.  There''s too much space over his head for me -- the framing and composition just aren''t working.', '2011-11-27 00:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604242, 985035, 138630, '<td valign="top">The high key, white on white look is very nice for showcasing her eyes -- which are very pretty, indeed.  I like the lowered saturation -- very porcelain doll looking.  The freckles are charming.</td>', 'The high key, white on white look is very nice for showcasing her eyes -- which are very pretty, indeed.  I like the lowered saturation -- very porcelain doll looking.  The freckles are charming.', '2011-11-27 00:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604316, 984846, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like.</td>', 'I like.', '2011-11-27 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604317, 985166, 118154, '<td valign="top">Cute and iike the choice of toning.</td>', 'Cute and iike the choice of toning.', '2011-11-27 10:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604319, 985008, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very natural look,a good image.</td>', 'Very natural look,a good image.', '2011-11-27 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604320, 984784, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the style.</td>', 'Like the style.', '2011-11-27 10:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604321, 984666, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice honest shot.</td>', 'Nice honest shot.', '2011-11-27 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604330, 985160, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not a feature I would have thought to remark on or photograph but what a very beautiful, long neck she has -- not at all out of proportion but very stately.  I love your cropping choices.  Beautiful model.  I would take a look at a horizontal flip -- hard to know.  Just an idea and not suggesting this orientation is not just fine.</td>', 'Not a feature I would have thought to remark on or photograph but what a very beautiful, long neck she has -- not at all out of proportion but very stately.  I love your cropping choices.  Beautiful model.  I would take a look at a horizontal flip -- hard to know.  Just an idea and not suggesting this orientation is not just fine.', '2011-11-27 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604331, 985175, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and you have found a great perspective for showcasing her lips -- the red lipstick doesn''t hurt, either.  I like the lighting and subtle framing.</td>', 'Beautiful model and you have found a great perspective for showcasing her lips -- the red lipstick doesn''t hurt, either.  I like the lighting and subtle framing.', '2011-11-27 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604800, 985109, 140777, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I think that in black and white it could had more impact.</td>', 'Nice capture. I think that in black and white it could had more impact.', '2011-11-28 00:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604806, 984768, 140777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait!', '2011-11-28 00:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604877, 985166, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great tones in this image.</td>', 'Great tones in this image.', '2011-11-28 02:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604878, 985135, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting to highlight this photo.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting to highlight this photo.', '2011-11-28 02:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604880, 984768, 97225, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done. Everything draws the eye to his face and his personality shines.</td>', 'Really nicely done. Everything draws the eye to his face and his personality shines.', '2011-11-28 02:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604882, 985159, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and focus, sweet face, and lovely hair.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and focus, sweet face, and lovely hair.', '2011-11-28 02:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604884, 985035, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key portrait. I love the way attention is focused on her beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Lovely high key portrait. I love the way attention is focused on her beautiful eyes.', '2011-11-28 02:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604885, 984718, 114225, '<td valign="top">sorry, but  think there are much more effective ways to highlight her eyes than using selective saturation.</td>', 'sorry, but  think there are much more effective ways to highlight her eyes than using selective saturation.', '2011-11-28 02:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604886, 985122, 97225, '<td valign="top">The title is well illustrated by the great interaction here.</td>', 'The title is well illustrated by the great interaction here.', '2011-11-28 02:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604888, 984856, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on the lighting here. seems like you are pointing out the forehead as the defining feature.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on the lighting here. seems like you are pointing out the forehead as the defining feature.', '2011-11-28 02:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604889, 985035, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great way to highlight the eyes.</td>', 'Great way to highlight the eyes.', '2011-11-28 02:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604890, 984987, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of those wonderful eyes.</td>', 'Great capture of those wonderful eyes.', '2011-11-28 02:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604891, 984659, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun photo with very nice lighting.</td>', 'Fun photo with very nice lighting.', '2011-11-28 02:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604892, 984867, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but it does not show a person''s defining feature, which I believe was the subject of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but it does not show a person''s defining feature, which I believe was the subject of the challenge.', '2011-11-28 02:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604893, 984683, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, this photo actually pulls my eyes to the out of focus person in the foreground. It w\took a while to find the main subject.</td>', 'It''s interesting, this photo actually pulls my eyes to the out of focus person in the foreground. It w\took a while to find the main subject.', '2011-11-28 02:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604895, 984867, 121784, '<td valign="top">A very different take on the challenge as most people took ''eyes''</td>', 'A very different take on the challenge as most people took ''eyes''', '2011-11-28 02:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604900, 985072, 97225, '<td valign="top">I doubt that this is the person''s defining feature.</td>', 'I doubt that this is the person''s defining feature.', '2011-11-28 02:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604902, 984660, 97225, '<td valign="top">This little fella''s expression is priceless. I''m not sure if he is the teller or the tellee, but I''m sure there''s a joke being shared.</td>', 'This little fella''s expression is priceless. I''m not sure if he is the teller or the tellee, but I''m sure there''s a joke being shared.', '2011-11-28 02:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604905, 984766, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait with eye-contact that imparts some personality. I find myself wanting to crop a bit off the left, but that''s just personal taste and no points deducted for that.</td>', 'Excellent portrait with eye-contact that imparts some personality. I find myself wanting to crop a bit off the left, but that''s just personal taste and no points deducted for that.', '2011-11-28 02:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604915, 985153, 63812, '<td valign="top">:-P nice</td>', ':-P nice', '2011-11-28 03:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
