(6604976, 984303, 119419, '<td valign="top">Exactly what I thought before I read the title! Wonderful and humorous.</td>', 'Exactly what I thought before I read the title! Wonderful and humorous.', '2011-11-28 06:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604977, 984443, 119419, '<td valign="top">Like</td>', 'Like', '2011-11-28 06:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604978, 985009, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice pout</td>', 'Nice pout', '2011-11-28 06:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604979, 984987, 119419, '<td valign="top">High tech dummy there ;! Certainly locked onto the target.</td>', 'High tech dummy there ;! Certainly locked onto the target.', '2011-11-28 06:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604980, 984846, 119419, '<td valign="top">Lovely shapes and shades.</td>', 'Lovely shapes and shades.', '2011-11-28 06:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604981, 984766, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very charismatic.</td>', 'Very charismatic.', '2011-11-28 06:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605079, 984635, 136337, '<td valign="top">It tells the story<br/> <br/>would like to see it in a square crop... too much empty/white space on the left side for my taste</td>', 'It tells the story would like to see it in a square crop... too much empty/white space on the left side for my taste', '2011-11-28 09:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605124, 985035, 129512, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=121949" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sjhuls</a>.. Either way, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'I''m thinking this is  sjhuls.. Either way, it''s a great shot!', '2011-11-28 09:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605127, 985153, 129512, '<td valign="top">Thanks Ken, Now I really won''t sleep tonight.</td>', 'Thanks Ken, Now I really won''t sleep tonight.', '2011-11-28 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605128, 984660, 129512, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a smile!</td>', 'Now that''s a smile!', '2011-11-28 09:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605129, 984303, 129512, '<td valign="top">LOL! I had to do a double take.</td>', 'LOL! I had to do a double take.', '2011-11-28 09:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605130, 985160, 129512, '<td valign="top">Nice work Sofia. Nicely Done.</td>', 'Nice work Sofia. Nicely Done.', '2011-11-28 09:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605239, 985160, 101141, '<td valign="top">What a great vein! So many portraits in this challenge seem to lack a defining feature, your''s is wonderful! I like how the vein creates a line down the middle and then the turned face gives draws in my vision to the vein.</td>', 'What a great vein! So many portraits in this challenge seem to lack a defining feature, your''s is wonderful! I like how the vein creates a line down the middle and then the turned face gives draws in my vision to the vein.', '2011-11-28 12:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605240, 984957, 101141, '<td valign="top">It seems to me her wrinkles are much more defining then her eyes in this photo - everyone has eyes, but few people have such awesome wrinkles!</td>', 'It seems to me her wrinkles are much more defining then her eyes in this photo - everyone has eyes, but few people have such awesome wrinkles!', '2011-11-28 12:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605242, 985035, 101141, '<td valign="top">There''s so many eyes that are supposed to be "defining features" in this challenge. But your picture, because of the limited colors, the eyes really pop out, unlike most eye pictures. Plus it''s a pretty picture overall.</td>', 'There''s so many eyes that are supposed to be "defining features" in this challenge. But your picture, because of the limited colors, the eyes really pop out, unlike most eye pictures. Plus it''s a pretty picture overall.', '2011-11-28 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605243, 985144, 101141, '<td valign="top">I like how the braid looks in this photo.</td>', 'I like how the braid looks in this photo.', '2011-11-28 12:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605258, 984303, 138630, '<td valign="top">Funny take on the theme.  I like the idea of the square crop -- works well with the whimsy of the shot -- but in terms of composition, I think it would look better if you lost the top of the image -- down to where the sidewalk ends (or starts) at least.  I do like the sharp silhouette and that nose tip :)</td>', 'Funny take on the theme.  I like the idea of the square crop -- works well with the whimsy of the shot -- but in terms of composition, I think it would look better if you lost the top of the image -- down to where the sidewalk ends (or starts) at least.  I do like the sharp silhouette and that nose tip :)', '2011-11-28 13:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605259, 985087, 138630, '<td valign="top">A real cutie, the colors are my favorite combination -- yellow or golden brown and blue, love it! -- and the eyes, though over-done for my taste, do jump out at the viewer.</td>', 'A real cutie, the colors are my favorite combination -- yellow or golden brown and blue, love it! -- and the eyes, though over-done for my taste, do jump out at the viewer.', '2011-11-28 13:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605260, 984766, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the candid look to this whether it was or not.  Wish his features, especially his eyes, were lighter.  I think that would give better balance to the image which, as it stands, almost seems more about the cigarette than the man.  Maybe you could have titled it "Smoker"?</td>', 'I like the candid look to this whether it was or not.  Wish his features, especially his eyes, were lighter.  I think that would give better balance to the image which, as it stands, almost seems more about the cigarette than the man.  Maybe you could have titled it "Smoker"?', '2011-11-28 13:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605261, 985156, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not sure the sideways look here works that well with the title which to means a dear friend I can really trust.  For that, I might prefer a more direct perspective.  The skin is over-processed for my taste, too.  I do like the position in the frame and the crop.</td>', 'Not sure the sideways look here works that well with the title which to means a dear friend I can really trust.  For that, I might prefer a more direct perspective.  The skin is over-processed for my taste, too.  I do like the position in the frame and the crop.', '2011-11-28 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605265, 985005, 138630, '<td valign="top">I am thinking s/he just dropped something?  It actually just looks like an icicle?  Would love to see an expression to go with this one.</td>', 'I am thinking s/he just dropped something?  It actually just looks like an icicle?  Would love to see an expression to go with this one.', '2011-11-28 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
