(6605267, 985161, 138630, '<td valign="top">I find the reflection distracting and the color too red.  I do like the placement of the pupil in the frame.</td>', 'I find the reflection distracting and the color too red.  I do like the placement of the pupil in the frame.', '2011-11-28 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
