(6605449, 984967, 138630, '<td valign="top">This guy does have a great smile and I can see why it would be contagious -- he also has a beard :)  Side lighting can be very dramatic but here it''s a bit strong.  I also wish the background was different -- both the line and the speckles are distracting.  Mostly, I wish you had found a different perspective.  I don''t think shooting up at a person is effective very often.</td>', 'This guy does have a great smile and I can see why it would be contagious -- he also has a beard :)  Side lighting can be very dramatic but here it''s a bit strong.  I also wish the background was different -- both the line and the speckles are distracting.  Mostly, I wish you had found a different perspective.  I don''t think shooting up at a person is effective very often.', '2011-11-28 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6605450, 985104, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very interesting detail, the color does not appeal.  More of an abstract than anything else to me.</td>', 'Very interesting detail, the color does not appeal.  More of an abstract than anything else to me.', '2011-11-28 20:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
