(6606373, 984683, 94265, '<td valign="top">Anyone voting as low as a 2-4 on this shot was clearly tactically voting down a shot they knew would do well. The sharpness, focus, DOF and subject are great in this image and it certainly meets the challenge in my eyes. I gave an 8, I would have gone higher but the man in the foreground does pull my eye since he''s so prominant in the photo, even though he and the background man are nicely bokehd. Looking at it again, I wish I''d given it a 9. Congrats on your high placing anyway!</td>', 'Anyone voting as low as a 2-4 on this shot was clearly tactically voting down a shot they knew would do well. The sharpness, focus, DOF and subject are great in this image and it certainly meets the challenge in my eyes. I gave an 8, I would have gone higher but the man in the foreground does pull my eye since he''s so prominant in the photo, even though he and the background man are nicely bokehd. Looking at it again, I wish I''d given it a 9. Congrats on your high placing anyway!', '2011-11-30 09:49:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6606374, 985160, 101707, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great Sofia. A big congrats from me!</td>', 'Absolutely great Sofia. A big congrats from me!', '2011-11-30 09:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
