(6606400, 984443, 54645, '<td valign="top">Really enjoyed this John. Well done.</td>', 'Really enjoyed this John. Well done.', '2011-11-30 10:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6606425, 984683, 50695, '<td valign="top">Anything that I give a ribbon to will have 2s, 3s and 4s on it, almost guaranteed. The largest and most foregrounded subject is completely out of focus. Left brains have trouble with that.</td>', 'Anything that I give a ribbon to will have 2s, 3s and 4s on it, almost guaranteed. The largest and most foregrounded subject is completely out of focus. Left brains have trouble with that.', '2011-11-30 11:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6606426, 984303, 50695, '<td valign="top">for people who are confused about Negative Space, or for people who think they know what Negative Space is, please see this photo. This is Negative Space Blue Ribbon.</td>', 'for people who are confused about Negative Space, or for people who think they know what Negative Space is, please see this photo. This is Negative Space Blue Ribbon.', '2011-11-30 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6606427, 985005, 50695, '<td valign="top">The subtlety here is astounding. We don''t see her face, we don''t see the act of destruction. All we see are a few shards of the aftermath, which she is towering over, all rendered ironic by the fact that the viewer towers over her. Excellent image.<br/></td>', 'The subtlety here is astounding. We don''t see her face, we don''t see the act of destruction. All we see are a few shards of the aftermath, which she is towering over, all rendered ironic by the fact that the viewer towers over her. Excellent image.', '2011-11-30 11:07:30.000000', NULL, 0),
